<h1>VPN Password Reset Process</h1>
<p>The purpose of this Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) is to outline the[3D[K
the steps for resetting a VPN password.</p>

<h2>Purpose</h2>
<p>This SOP aims to ensure that VPN passwords are reset securely and effici[6D[K
efficiently, minimizing downtime and data breaches.</p>

<h2>Scope</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Applicable to all employees with access to the company's VPN.</li>
  <li>Applies to all situations where a VPN password needs to be reset.</li[10D[K
reset.</li>
</ul>

