<h2>Procedure</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Step 1: Contact IT department to request password reset. Provide empl[4D[K
employee's username and reason for requesting password reset.</li>
  <li>Step 2: The IT department will verify the employee's identity and ens[3D[K
ensure they meet all eligibility criteria.</li>
  <li>Step 3: If approved, the IT department will reset the VPN password an[2D[K
and send a notification to the employee with the new credentials.</li>
  <li>Step 4: The employee is expected to log in using their new VPN passwo[6D[K
password immediately after receiving the notification.</li>
</ol>

